Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-Third Episode\NThe Spider Island
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is a ship in the shape\Nof a swan! How big and beautiful it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.74,0:02:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll run to the castle right away\Nto tell Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, wake up! In the lake\Nthere's a beautiful swan-ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.94,0:03:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Look! Isn't it magnificent?\N- A swan-ship?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.38,0:03:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a strange shape for a ship.\NI wonder who it belongs to..!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go see it up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.70,0:03:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to try to get on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come aboard if you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.78,0:03:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin\Nhad this ship built..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...specially for you, Prince.\NYou may come aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.06,0:03:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the Grand Duke is very keen\Non you having a good time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.26,0:03:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit strange\Nthat the Grand Duke desires this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.82,0:03:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but the ship is inviting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.46,0:03:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you will come aboard,\NPrince.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.54,0:03:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, we will go on board\Nand have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.02,0:03:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear little son!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.50,0:03:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Plastic, I have a wonderful\Ngift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.22,0:04:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.06,0:04:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never give you\Nsuch an insignificant gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.06,0:04:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole of Silverland will be yours,\Ntomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.50,0:04:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen\Nthat beautiful swan-ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.14,0:04:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as Sapphire\Nsets foot on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.86,0:04:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,it will sail towards the lonely\Nisland of roses!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.10,0:04:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.10,0:04:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ah, it's you!\N- Everything is going for the best
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Magnificent!\N- Everything is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.06,0:04:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We have scrupulously followed\Nyour instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.10,0:04:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship was built\Nas you commanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.42,0:04:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Also the work on the island\Nhas been completed...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...according to your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.70,0:04:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess will disappear\Non the deserted island...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.30,0:04:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...and no one will notice.\NThen everything will go according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.58,0:04:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.02,0:04:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That ship is really beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.82,0:04:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How nice! It would be fun\Nto take a trip on this ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.38,0:04:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We could sail for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.02,0:05:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Tink! The ship has set sail!\NIt's sailing by itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Save us! Help!\N- Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's shouting?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.26,0:05:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.02,0:05:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! Franz!\NPlease, help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Prince Franz!\N- Help, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.78,0:06:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, he can't do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.74,0:06:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, the rudder isn't working!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.42,0:06:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We almost crashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz followed us\Nonto the cliff!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I'll try to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How brave he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.78,0:07:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy\Nto be able to be near you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.66,0:07:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's raining...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.34,0:07:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What a downpour!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come under here\Nto take shelter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all the same,\Nwe're fine here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.26,0:08:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What a magnificent island this is!\NIt's full of roses!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.78,0:08:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's something strange...\NThese roses are truly beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.54,0:08:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- but they don't smell at all.\N- This island is strange, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try to find out why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.42,0:08:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, a tunnel of roses!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.06,0:08:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait! Wait, hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Tink go?\NHe was right behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.94,0:08:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tink!\N- Tink, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, answer me! Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.34,0:09:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Franz: the roses!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.14,0:09:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, watch out!\NThere's something strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.62,0:09:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Look, Franz!\N- And what do these cats want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.82,0:09:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, take cover behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.86,0:09:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If they want to harm us,\NI will face them with my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.78,0:09:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe they are just cats.\NPerhaps they are evil spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.86,0:09:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I will fight too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.66,0:09:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need, leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, they're circling us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.94,0:10:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Franz!\N- Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!\NThe cats are tearing my dress!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.42,0:10:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.34,0:10:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.78,0:11:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The mysterious knight\Nis not afraid of you, you nasty cats!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.58,0:11:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But where could Franz have ended up\Nnow?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.66,0:11:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.26,0:12:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.50,0:12:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! Tink! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.38,0:12:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Franz! Tink!\N- Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.38,0:12:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But you are the mysterious knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.86,0:12:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't worry, I'll free you now.\N- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.90,0:12:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps Prince Franz\Nhas also been captured by the cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't say that this\Nis a normal island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I let myself get caught\Nlike a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.06,0:12:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of looking for Franz
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.94,0:12:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But how will you look for him\Non such a dangerous island?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find him, you'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.86,0:12:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange...! This spiderweb\Nis as thick as a rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.22,0:12:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I must find out who made it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost consciousness, Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.78,0:13:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?\NWhy have you captured me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.54,0:13:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to know who I am? I am\Nthe Spider-Man, master of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.58,0:13:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I was waiting for you, because I knew\Nthe swan ship had set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.26,0:13:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My master ordered me\Nto kill Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.46,0:13:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't expect her\Nlover to be with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So, at this point,\NI’ll get rid of you first!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.06,0:13:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was all a\Nprearranged plan, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.18,0:13:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly! That's why you'll share\Nthe fate of your dear Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.50,0:13:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be happy, shouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.90,0:14:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.02,0:14:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The mysterious knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.10,0:14:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.70,0:14:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit,\Nthis rope won't break!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no ordinary rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.38,0:14:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea, Tink! Look\Nfor some water somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.06,0:14:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Right away!\N- What happened to Princess Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.22,0:14:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is doing just\Nfine, don't worry about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.10,0:14:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! But\Nyou, mysterious knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you always\Nappear when she isn't here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time\Nnow to discuss this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to escape from here\Nwhile the spider-man is sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.06,0:15:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I found the water, but\Nwhat do you need it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.62,0:15:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Pour it on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.74,0:15:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Now let's run! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.58,0:15:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy has escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll catch him again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.70,0:15:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go on anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Tink, or he'll catch us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You go on ahead, I'm too tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A scratch will be enough\Nwith these poisoned stilettos...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.54,0:16:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,...to make you lose your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.30,0:16:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And now for the two of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.62,0:16:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz is wounded and the\Npoison is starting to take effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.22,0:16:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you plan to do?\N- We must leave here immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.70,0:16:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And we must look for the antidote!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay for my wound!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, I've heard that\Nwhere an evil monster lives...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.62,0:17:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...a plant grows that\Nneutralizes the poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Try looking around here. Maybe\Nyou'll be able to find this plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.90,0:17:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll find it for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.78,0:17:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, Sapphire...\N- Yes, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.42,0:17:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire... Sapphire!\N- The fever is making him delirious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.46,0:17:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Franz! If we don't\Nfind the antidote, he will die
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.70,0:17:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The mysterious knight\Nwill try once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Courage, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.70,0:18:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I am beside you. Don't worry,\NFranz, you'll be saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the herb! I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.14,0:18:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It will remove the effect of the\NSpider-Man's poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.82,0:18:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?\NHave you returned again, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.26,0:18:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.06,0:18:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Give me the plant immediately.\N- Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.22,0:18:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope\Nit really works..
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.46,0:18:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he should recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.10,0:18:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no excuses\Nthat will hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.94,0:19:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I didn't foresee that\NFranz would come here too,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.06,0:19:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're a professional! You cannot\Nbe defeated by a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.50,0:19:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't beaten me yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.34,0:19:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I wounded him\Nwith the poisoned stiletto..
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...when he pierced me. By now\Nthe poison will have already taken effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.42,0:19:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I am here to receive from you\NSapphire's body!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the promise\Nthat you made me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.14,0:19:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you so inept as to retreat\Nover a small wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.26,0:19:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and kill Sapphire with\Nthe web you are so proud of!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.10,0:19:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I will return to the island as soon\Nas I know she has been finished off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.54,0:19:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.30,0:19:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Sapphire go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.74,0:19:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Sapphire was here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.34,0:19:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! She was beside me and\Ntended to me all night long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.82,0:20:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink has already sent her\Nhome flying on the back of a swan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.02,0:20:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But then it wasn't her last night!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have dreamed of\Nher in your feverish delirium.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.38,0:20:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the two of us must\Nthink about repairing the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.06,0:20:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.30,0:20:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the rudder works!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I fixed the hull.\NWe can set off again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.58,0:20:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't!\NPrincess Sapphire, I will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Spider-Man!\N- You are dressed in strange clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's you, Sapphire, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I am\Nthe mysterious knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.86,0:20:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter! Whoever you are,\NI won't leave you alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.82,0:20:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You, my friends,\Ntake care of the brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.14,0:20:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of you..!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.74,0:21:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a very powerful drug,\Nthat you will like and that will make you sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.18,0:21:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.02,0:21:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the end for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.34,0:22:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tink, are you okay?\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.94,0:22:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The cats ate a drug\Nand now they are sleeping soundly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.74,0:22:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse it, I didn't make it!\NBut it doesn't end here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.78,0:22:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give up so easily,\Nyou little pests!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.22,0:22:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I will manage to kill you, Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.50,0:22:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and seize the throne,\Nsooner or later!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.30,0:22:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I will never forget...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.86,0:22:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...how sweet you were\Ntaking care of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.34,0:22:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,even if they say\Nthat it was a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.86,0:22:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, I'm glad\Nthat you said it.
